# W_V4_EXPERIMENT=1 - THIS IS NOT THE MACHINE. 1 knob(s) off the bank: LIN2_CROSS_WOB is 1, ruled 12 ("add the wob12 to all crosses to ib and crosses to in-mom-fnc" - 1027. Five sites: t1, t2, the retest gate, and both pass-bar rules. Supersedes L2_CWS1R_WOB 1 on the retest cross and the "xwob 1" header ruling. Crosses INTO oob or ex-fence still carry no dwell)
